  <footer class="tiny"><strong data-i18n="independent">Independent companion for Flud.</strong><br><span data-i18n="notAffiliated">Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Delphi Softwares or the Flud developers.</span><br><span data-i18n="compatibility">“Flud” is used only to identify compatibility.</span> · alexlab.media</footer>
</main>
<div id="howToModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet"><div class="sheetHead"><h2 data-i18n="howToTitle">Setup guide</h2><button class="close" data-close="howToModal">×</button></div><p class="muted" data-i18n="howToIntro">Follow these steps once. LAN works without Cloudflare; Remote uses a relay in your own Cloudflare account.</p><ol class="steps"><li data-i18n="step1">Install Flud or Flud+ and Flud Companion Bridge on the Android device.</li><li data-i18n="step2">Open Bridge → Quick setup. Choose LAN only, or LAN + Remote.</li><li data-i18n="step3">For automatic confirmation, enable Flud Companion Auto-start in Android Accessibility. On some Android TV devices this first activation must be done manually.</li><li data-i18n="step4">For Remote: create/sign in to a free Cloudflare account, choose Deploy relay in Bridge, and allow the Worker + R2 mailbox to be created.</li><li data-i18n="step5">After deployment, copy your HTTPS relay URL (usually *.workers.dev).</li><li data-i18n="step6">Back in Bridge: Remote relay setup → paste the relay URL → enable Remote relay.</li><li data-i18n="step7">Scan Remote QR with the phone. For direct home-network use, scan Local QR instead.</li><li data-i18n="step8">Use Flud Companion from iPhone, Android, tablet or desktop. On supported browsers, choose Add to Home Screen / Install app for an app-like launch.</li></ol></div></div>
<div id="beerModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet"><div class="sheetHead"><h2>🍺 <span data-i18n="beerTitle">Offer me a beer</span></h2><button class="close" data-close="beerModal">×</button></div><p class="supportText" data-i18n="beerText">If you appreciate Flud Companion and the time spent building it, you can leave any small token of appreciation. Thank you.</p><a class="primary supportLink" href="https://www.paypal.me/AlexandruCiobanu00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openPayPal">Open PayPal</a></div></div>
<div id="supportReminderModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet compactSheet"><div class="sheetHead"><h2>🍺 <span data-i18n="supportReminderTitle">50 magnets sent</span></h2><button class="close" data-close="supportReminderModal">×</button></div><p class="supportText" data-i18n="supportReminderText">Flud Companion has handled another 50 successful sends on this browser. If it saves you time, a small donation is always appreciated.</p><div class="reminderActions"><button class="secondary" data-close="supportReminderModal" data-i18n="maybeLater">Maybe later</button><a class="primary supportLink" href="https://www.paypal.me/AlexandruCiobanu00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openPayPal">Open PayPal</a></div></div></div>
